 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nNorthwind Trading Inc                                              MASTER SERVICES\n450 Madison Avenue, 73301 Austin, United States                   AGREEMENT\nVAT No: US45-5403043\n\nFROM                                                             BILL TO\nNorthwind Trading Inc                                            Summit Medical Devices Inc\n450 Madison Avenue                                               1200 Industrial Parkway\n73301 Austin                                                     80201 Denver\nUnited States                                                    United States\nVAT: US45-5403043\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 04/01/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Northwind\nTrading Inc, with its registered office at 450 Madison Avenue, Austin (\"Party A\"), and Summit Medical Devices Inc, with its registered\noffice at 1200 Industrial Parkway, Denver (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Northwind Trading Inc / Sarah Mitchell\nParty B    Summit Medical Devices Inc / John Carter\nDate       04/01/2026",
